WEBVTT

00:00:03.971 --> 00:00:05.233
You just let Shen get away!
你就这样放走了姓沈的！

00:00:05.407 --> 00:00:06.844
At least we destroyed
the weapon.
至少我们毁了他的武器

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:13.372
Fire!
开火！

00:00:15.896 --> 00:00:17.680
Oh, no, he's got way more.
不，他还有很多

00:00:20.031 --> 00:00:21.119
Aargh, aargh!

00:00:24.035 --> 00:00:25.863
- My wing!
- Help, Po!
我的翅膀！ 救命，阿宝！

00:00:26.037 --> 00:00:27.690
Coming! Aaargh!
来了！

00:00:27.865 --> 00:00:29.562
- Watch out!
- Po!
小心！

00:00:31.477 --> 00:00:33.479
Whoa. Wow!

00:00:33.653 --> 00:00:36.482
- Help me up!
- No. Get him down.
拉起我！ 不

00:00:36.656 --> 00:00:38.136
Use the ropes.
把他放下，用绳子

00:00:41.052 --> 00:00:43.010
Waaargh!

00:00:47.101 --> 00:00:49.147
Run, run, little panda!
快跑啊，小熊猫！

00:00:51.453 --> 00:00:53.368
Whoa! [screams]

00:00:53.542 --> 00:00:54.500
[screeches]

00:00:58.286 --> 00:01:00.245
[panting]

00:01:00.419 --> 00:01:02.464
Po, come on.
We need you to focus!
阿宝，你需要精神集中！ 我懂得!

00:01:02.638 --> 00:01:05.206
- I got it, I got it!
- Bring it down!
拿下塔楼！

00:01:08.775 --> 00:01:10.733
- We're trapped!
- This way!
我们受困了！ 这边！

00:01:11.778 --> 00:01:13.780
[rumbling]

00:01:13.954 --> 00:01:16.870
[laughing] Goodbye!
再见！

00:01:17.915 --> 00:01:19.003
Yah!

00:01:19.960 --> 00:01:21.266
Fire!
开火！

00:01:22.745 --> 00:01:25.052
Get back!
回去！

00:01:25.226 --> 00:01:27.054
Hah! Hah!

00:01:32.233 --> 00:01:34.801
- The only way out is up.
- Aaargh!
逃出去的唯一出路是往上走

00:01:34.975 --> 00:01:36.977
[all] What? [screaming]

00:01:43.070 --> 00:01:45.029
Yee-hah!

00:01:46.421 --> 00:01:47.422
Whoo-hoo!
跟我走！快！

00:01:47.596 --> 00:01:49.511
Follow me! Come on!
跟我走！快！

00:01:50.686 --> 00:01:52.775
- Where are they going?
- To the top!
他们上哪儿去？

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:55.039
Come on! Keep going!
塔顶！ 继续走！

00:02:02.089 --> 00:02:03.569
Here we go!
走了！

00:02:07.355 --> 00:02:09.314
Whoa-aahh!

00:02:22.283 --> 00:02:23.632
You idiot!
白痴！

00:02:23.806 --> 00:02:25.852
Ow! My nose!
我的鼻子！

00:02:26.026 --> 00:02:29.812
Call in the wolves!
All of them. I want them ready
to move!
狼群全部调进来！准备开战！

00:02:29.987 --> 00:02:33.947
The Year of the Peacock
begins now!
孔雀元年开始了！

00:02:34.121 --> 00:02:35.601
Right now?
现在？现在可是年中啊

00:02:35.775 --> 00:02:37.429
'Cause it's the middle
of the year,
现在？现在可是年中啊

00:02:37.603 --> 00:02:39.866
so you'd only get,
like, a half of the
Year of the Peacock.
现在开始元年只能有半年

00:02:41.650 --> 00:02:45.306
And this is the Year,
of course, of the Peacock.
现在当然是孔雀元年

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:46.917
Happy New Year, sir.
新年快乐，大人

00:02:50.703 --> 00:02:55.012
Get the wolves ready.
We're loading the ships now.
准备狼群，准备船只

00:02:55.186 --> 00:02:56.317
Now!
快！

00:02:56.491 --> 00:02:58.406
Now, now, now, now!
快！马上！

00:02:58.580 --> 00:03:01.279
Move! Move, move, move, move!
快走！快走！

00:03:07.981 --> 00:03:09.940
[howls]

00:03:17.773 --> 00:03:19.732
[Tigress] This way.
这边走

00:03:23.779 --> 00:03:25.520
- [howling]
- Let's go.
走吧

00:03:27.958 --> 00:03:30.743
[grunting]

00:03:30.917 --> 00:03:34.225
Oh, you! What did you do?
It's chaos up there.
你做了什么？乱作一团，
你说要捉姓沈的？

00:03:34.399 --> 00:03:36.009
What happened
to stopping Shen?
你做了什么？乱作一团，
你说要捉姓沈的？

00:03:37.532 --> 00:03:39.317
Yeah.
对

00:03:40.579 --> 00:03:42.755
Guys, come on.
Give me a little credit.
各位，想想看，我应该有功劳吧

00:03:42.929 --> 00:03:45.888
I meant for him to get away
because, uh...
我故意放走他的！这是个小小计谋

00:03:46.063 --> 00:03:48.239
...it was a trick.
It was a plot.
我故意放走他的！这是个小小计谋

00:03:48.413 --> 00:03:53.200
I was thinking...
I'll figure out his plot more.
这会让我更了解他的阴谋

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:55.986
That makes no sense.
根本说不过去

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:59.119
- What do you mean?
Sure it does.
- Po, the truth.
当然说得过去

00:03:59.293 --> 00:04:01.817
- You had Shen. What happened?
- What are you talking about?
阿宝，说真话，
你抓住了姓沈的，怎么回事？

00:04:01.992 --> 00:04:04.733
I don't know what
you're talking about. I...
Yeah...
什么？你这话是什么意思，
他趁我没防备时溜了

00:04:04.907 --> 00:04:06.257
OK, he caught me off guard.
什么？你这话是什么意思，
他趁我没防备时溜了

00:04:07.084 --> 00:04:09.042
The truth.
说真话

00:04:11.566 --> 00:04:15.309
Fine. They will keep you
far from danger.
他们能让你远离危险

00:04:15.483 --> 00:04:18.008
- Real far.
- What?
非常远

00:04:18.182 --> 00:04:20.227
You're staying here.
你待在这里

00:04:20.401 --> 00:04:22.403
W... Wait!
等等！

00:04:22.577 --> 00:04:24.188
I have to go ba...
我要回去

